# This repo is developed on Windows. Anything a Linux container or the Docker
# daemon reads must be checked out with LF, or it fails inside the container in
# ways that look like a defect in the image.
* text=auto

*.sql text eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
Dockerfile text eol=lf
.dockerignore text eol=lf
# Copied to .env and parsed by Compose; a trailing CR would ride along inside
# every value, so a password would silently fail to authenticate.
.env.example text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
*.proto text eol=lf
